      "id": "carplay-explains-home-assistant-action-failures",
      "title": "CarPlay stops leaving Home Assistant commands hanging",
      "dek": "A ten-second timeout replaces an endless executing message with an explanation when a command cannot reach home.",
      "body": [
        "A failed Home Assistant command in CarPlay no longer leaves its row saying ‘Executing…’ indefinitely. A ten-second timeout ends the wait, and a visible alert explains failures—including a lost connection to Home Assistant—instead of leaving the explanation in a log.",
